</style><h2>BlinkyBot 0.3.9</h2><ul><li><strong>The model picker lists the CLI&#x27;s real models.</strong> Codex fills the list from <code>model/list</code>, so it is no longer only the word default. Claude Code offers the aliases Opus, Sonnet, and Haiku.</li><li><strong>Paste or drop an image and it reaches the CLI.</strong> The image stays on the message. Codex receives it as a local image file. Claude Code receives it as an image block.</li></ul><p><a href="https://github.com/harrisliangsu/blinky-bot/releases/tag/v0.3.9">Release notes on GitHub</a></p>]]></description>
